(
    title: "Acid Drop",
    developer: Some("Salu (Dennis M. Kiss)"),
    description: Some("A falling-block puzzle in the Columns mould. Coloured blocks descend three at a time, and as in Columns you reorder the colours within each falling triple to line up three or more of one colour horizontally or vertically; matched blocks vanish and everything above drops into the gap. Let the stack reach the top and the game ends. At score milestones a special \"acid drop\" block appears and clears several columns at once."),
